BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:3rd Annual Foliage 5K & Little Leaf Dash
DTSTART:20261010T090000
DTEND:20261010T130000
DTSTAMP:20261010T161636Z
UID:3dd80001672ac3e9b13609c99ea99a@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The Winston Prouty Center for Child and Family Development inv
 ites runners\, walkers\, families\, and fall-foliage fans to the 3rd Annua
 l Foliage 5K Trail Run and Little Leaf Dash on Saturday\, Oct. 10\, on its
  campus at 209 Austine Drive in Brattleboro. The event offers a scenic way
  to enjoy the autumn landscape while raising funds for Winston Prouty’s 
 inclusive early childhood education\, family support\, and community-based
  services. Registration opens at 9 a.m. The Little Leaf Dash begins at 10 
 a.m. with a half-mile route suitable for young children\, strollers\, and 
 babes in arms. The 5K Trail Run starts at 10:15 a.m. and takes runners and
  walkers through open fields and forested trails\, with 510 feet of elevat
 ion gain\, scenic views\, and prizes for top finishers and standout race s
 pirit. Costumes are encouraged! After the races\, guests can enjoy family-
 friendly activities\, including pumpkin carving\, apple cider pressing\, f
 ace painting\, and lawn games. Mama T’s Sweet Spot will be offering comf
 ort food and baked goods for sale. 209 Austine Dr Brattleboro \, Vermont 0
 5301 8022577852 daniela@winstonprouty.org winstonprouty.org/moyc Submit An
