 s: Saturdays\, 3:30–6pm\, September & October\, with bands starting at 4
 pm · Saturday\, September 19: Jenni Johnson & The Junketeers\, Pascolo ·
  Saturday\, September 26: Jon McBride’s Big Easy\, Honey Road · Saturda
 y\, October 3: Mother of Pearl\, Halvorson’s · Saturday\, October 10: N
